    "integration_evidence": [
        "Tier equal-level encrypted runs and bound final merges to configured fan-in",
        "Limit live catalogue to128 inputs plus one scratch output and open at most four readers plus output",
        "Reserve complete output alongside retained input ciphertext before writes",
        "Withhold output final authentication until every input final tag, strict key order and declared count/length verifies",
        "Poison all failed append/read/merge/callback operations and reject valid-prefix finalization",
        "Preserve replaced inode and unrelated files on retirement/destruction",
        "Verify257 reverse byte-path entries against independent logical manifest order/digest and repeat reads",
        "Bound cumulative rewrite reservation to eight times individually encrypted inputs in regression fixture",
        "Account metadata/merge/chunk scratch within8MiB and preallocate zeroized path keys",
        "Accept opaque colon endpoint IDs while keeping generated filename IDs strict"
    ],
